  m_text: '1.<indent=48>A class of antibiotics that may increase the insulin release
    and enhance the effects of glucose lowering drugs<indent=0>

    2.<indent=48>A
    class of OHGAs that is metabolized by CYP2C9<indent=0>

    3.<indent=48>A bacteriostatic
    antibiotic that may precipitate serotonin toxicity and hypoglycaemia<indent=0>

    4.<indent=48>A
    class of drugs that has potent CYP3A, CYP2C9 and CYP2C19 inhibitory effects<indent=0>

    5.<indent=48>_
    l _ _ _ l _ is more predisposed to hypoglycaemia<indent=0>

    6.<indent=48>_
    _ _ _ _ _ _ _ renal and hepatic function increase the risk of hypoglycemia when
    on concurrent OHGAs<indent=0>

    7.<indent=48>R _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ in dose of
    OHGAs should be considered for patient with erratic/decreased oral intake<indent=0>

'
